            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abwira Mose ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Vugana n’Abisirayeli ubabwire uti: ‘Umwisirayeli canke umunyamahanga aba muri mwebwe azotanga umwe mu bana biwe ngo ashikanirwe ikigirwamana Moleki aze yicwe. Abantu b’ubwoko bwanyu baze bamwicishe amabuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igitsure canje nzogishira kuri uwo muntu kandi nzomukura mu bwoko bwiwe; kuko azoba ahumanije ahera hanje kandi atukishije izina ryanje, mu gutanga abana biwe kw’ibimazi vya Moleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu nibirabira hirya igihe uwo muntu azotanga umwe mu bana biwe kuri Moleki ntibamwice, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nzohindukiriza igitsure canje kuri abo bantu n’imiryango yabo kandi nzobakura mu bwoko bwabo. Ivyo bizoba kuri we no ku bamukurikira mu kwihumanisha ico kigirwamana Moleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igitsure canje kizoba ku muntu wese ahamagara imizimu n’abapfumu akihumanisha kuvyizigira no kubikurikira. Nzomuca mu muryango wiwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
